---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-[var(--color-border)] space-y-12">
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
    <div class="text-label text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-mono tracking-widest">
      BACKGROUND
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-h1 font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] tracking-tight">
      About Me
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
    <!-- Narrative Body Paragraphs (2 Columns on Desktop) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I am a <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Computer Science graduate</strong> with a strong foundation in software engineering, backend architecture, and modern web application development.
      </p>
      <p>
        My core technical focus centers on building reliable full-stack applications using Node.js, Express, React, and MongoDB, alongside automated workflow tooling. I value clean code structure, practical API design, and intuitive user interfaces.
      </p>
      <p>
        Early in my professional journey, I bring internship experience across web development, reporting tool creation, and digital operations. I am actively seeking software engineering opportunities where I can solve real problems and contribute to production web systems.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Education Block (1 Column on Desktop) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-1 rounded-[var(--radius-md)] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6 space-y-4 h-fit">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-[var(--color-accent-text)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path>
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0112 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 01-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Education</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-[var(--color-border)]/60 pt-3">
        <h4 class="text-small font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">B.Sc. Computer Science</h4>
        <div class="text-meta text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-mono">Caleb University</div>
        <div class="text-meta text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] font-mono">September 2022 – August 2026</div>
        <div class="pt-2 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
          <span class="rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-background)] px-2 py-1 inline-block">
            Second Class Upper Honors
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
